    "quote": {
      "url": "https://x.com/PostureUni/status/2101468886650728956",
      "id": "2101468886650728956",
      "text": "A better posture isn\u2019t just about \u201cpulling your shoulders back.\u201d\n\nThis sequence uses a foam roller to challenge shoulder mobility, upper-back extension, and trunk positioning in different ways.\n\nThe key is not forcing the range.\n\nMove slowly, breathe, and let the ribcage and shoulders gradually find a more comfortable position.\n\n1 minute can be a useful reset\u2014but consistent practice is what creates lasting changes in movement habits.\n\nYour posture is something you train, not something you simply \u201chold.\u201d",
      "raw_text": {
        "text": "A better posture isn\u2019t just about \u201cpulling your shoulders back.\u201d\n\nThis sequence uses a foam roller to challenge shoulder mobility, upper-back extension, and trunk positioning in different ways.\n\nThe key is not forcing the range.\n\nMove slowly, breathe, and let the ribcage and shoulders gradually find a more comfortable position.\n\n1 minute can be a useful reset\u2014but consistent practice is what creates lasting changes in movement habits.\n\nYour posture is something you train, not something you simply \u201chold.\u201d",
